Word frequency data — wordfreq
================================================================================

data/zipf.json is derived from the `wordfreq` Python package (MIT licence),
which blends frequency counts from books, Wikipedia, news, subtitles and web
text. Only a derived Zipf value per word is retained; no source corpus is
redistributed here.

    https://github.com/rspeer/wordfreq
